error[algo/bound-dimension-mismatch]: `y` is read at dimension `nat` but bound at dimension `nat*`
  ┌─ ../../../../testdata/spec/neg/algo/dataflow-read-iterated-binding-in-output.watsup:5:14
  │
5 │ def $f(x*) = y
  │              ^ `y` is read here
6 │   -- (if y = $(x + 1))*
  │          - bound here
  │
  = A variable bound inside an iteration holds one value per iteration. Read it inside the same iterations, or as a whole through an iteration such as `y*`.

